### 13.3 Standard Risk Categories

| Risk | Likelihood | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Demand below forecast** | Medium | High | Conservative base case uses diversity factors. Monitor uptake quarterly. Prepare demand stimulation programme. |
| **Tariff affordability** | Medium | High | Willingness-to-pay survey required. Consider lifeline tariff for basic consumption. |
| **Solar resource variability** | Low | Medium | PVGIS satellite data averaged over 18+ years. Ground measurements recommended for detailed design. |
| **Equipment supply chain** | Medium | Medium | Procure from established Tier-1 suppliers. Allow 3-month lead time. |
| **Battery degradation** | Low | High | LFP chemistry selected for longevity. Replacement CAPEX provisioned at Year 10. |
| **Regulatory change** | Low | High | Monitor regulatory developments. Design for grid compatibility from day one. |
{% if grid_arrival and grid_arrival.evidence_summary.get("assessment") in ["imminent", "likely"] %}
| **Grid arrival (stranded asset)** | {{ "High" if grid_arrival.evidence_summary.get("assessment") == "imminent" else "Medium" }} | High | {{ grid_arrival.design_implications[:100] }}... |
{% else %}
| **Grid arrival** | Low | Medium | Design inverter for grid-forming capability. Annual monitoring of utility plans. |
{% endif %}
| **Construction delays** | Medium | Medium | Engage experienced EPC contractor. Include liquidated damages in contract. |
| **Community opposition** | Low | Medium | Early stakeholder engagement. Transparent tariff-setting process. |
| **Foreign exchange** | Medium | Medium | Revenue in local currency; costs partly in USD. Include FX contingency. |
| **Theft / vandalism** | Low–Medium | Medium | Site security included in OPEX. Community ownership stake recommended. |

